{"page":172,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:164","surah":7,"ayah":164,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَتْ أُمَّةٌ مِّنْهُمْ لِمَ تَعِظُونَ قَوْمًا ۙ ٱللَّهُ مُهْلِكُهُمْ أَوْ مُعَذِّبُهُمْ عَذَابًا شَدِيدًا ۖ قَالُوا۟ مَعْذِرَةً إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ وَلَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"how, when some of them asked [their preachers], ‘Why do you bother preaching to people God will destroy, or at least punish severely?’ [the preachers] answered, ‘In order to be free from your Lord’s blame, and so that they may perhaps take heed.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَتْ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qālat","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُمَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a community","transliteration":"ummatun","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِمَ","en_gloss":"Why","transliteration":"lima","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَعِظُونَ","en_gloss":"(do) you preach","transliteration":"taʿiẓūna","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْمًا ۙ","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(whom) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُهْلِكُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is going to) destroy them","transliteration":"muh'likuhum","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُعَذِّبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"punish them","transliteration":"muʿadhibuhum","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"(with) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":13,"ar":"شَدِيدًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdan","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"7:164"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَعْذِرَةً","en_gloss":"To be absolved","transliteration":